# ServiceLoader registration for classpath consumers.
#
# module-info.java already declares "provides ReasonerService with
# ElkSnomedReasonerService", but a provides directive is only honoured when this
# jar is on the MODULE path. On the classpath the descriptor is inert and
# ServiceLoader reads this file instead, so without it the reasoner is invisible
# to any classpath application — tinkar-service among them, where RunReasoner
# failed with "No ReasonerService implementation found via SPI".
#
# Both registrations are needed and they do not conflict: on the module path the
# JDK uses the descriptor and ignores this file.
dev.ikm.tinkar.reasoner.elksnomed.ElkSnomedReasonerService
